WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.490 --> 00:00:02.743
(Archer panting)
(rock music)

00:00:02.743 --> 00:00:03.576
- Rampage!

00:00:06.557 --> 00:00:07.430
(Lana scoffs)

00:00:07.430 --> 00:00:10.760
- Sterling Malory Archer

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:12.960
- [Male] Code name Duchess.

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:15.030
- So here's the thing, I need to access

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:17.740
my operations account, and
you're preventing that.

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:20.810
Now we can do this easy,
or we can do it hard.

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:23.574
- The thought of being
dead gives you an erection?

00:00:23.574 --> 00:00:25.099
- Jesus Christ!

00:00:25.099 --> 00:00:26.612
- Your call.

00:00:26.612 --> 00:00:28.052
(glass shatters)

00:00:28.052 --> 00:00:29.780
- Woo, hoo, hoo hoo!

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:31.540
- [Group] Drink, drink, drink!

00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:33.320
- Oh, oh, ow, ow!

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:34.153
Bawk, bawk.

00:00:34.153 --> 00:00:35.509
- Archer!

00:00:35.509 --> 00:00:36.640
- I'm coming!

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:37.803
Phasing, move!

00:00:38.840 --> 00:00:41.007
(screams)

00:00:42.376 --> 00:00:44.426
- Okay, let's try that again (screaming).

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:46.981
Survey says.

00:00:46.981 --> 00:00:47.814
(gunshot)
(man screaming)

00:00:47.814 --> 00:00:49.390
- Don't try to do anything stupid.

00:00:49.390 --> 00:00:51.203
- I don't have to try.

00:00:52.864 --> 00:00:54.224
(grunts)

00:00:54.224 --> 00:00:55.658
(screams)

00:00:55.658 --> 00:00:58.045
I'll show you who's boss!

00:00:58.045 --> 00:00:59.795
How do you like that?

00:01:02.759 --> 00:01:04.523
- Hey, asshole!

00:01:04.523 --> 00:01:05.356
- Lana.

00:01:07.011 --> 00:01:07.844
Lana

00:01:09.227 --> 00:01:10.060
(dishes smashing)

00:01:10.060 --> 00:01:10.893
Lana

00:01:12.687 --> 00:01:13.879
Lana!

00:01:13.879 --> 00:01:15.301
- What?!

00:01:15.301 --> 00:01:16.420
- Danger Zone.

00:01:16.420 --> 00:01:18.842
- Sterling Archer, I'd like you

00:01:18.842 --> 00:01:21.577
to meet your daughter, Abijean.

00:01:21.577 --> 00:01:23.840
- Why is that hoo named like me?

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:25.600
- Because he's your son!

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:27.800
You colossal idiot.

00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:29.740
- Until you can look at your mother,

00:01:29.740 --> 00:01:31.940
and see her not just as your mother,

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:33.330
but as a person.

00:01:33.330 --> 00:01:35.590
- When have I ever been
honest with Sterling?

00:01:35.590 --> 00:01:36.619
- [Burt] You can't grow up.

00:01:36.619 --> 00:01:37.900
(baby wailing)

00:01:37.900 --> 00:01:39.913
- Honey, you still got it.

00:01:39.913 --> 00:01:42.171
Bow chicka bow bow, ah huh huh!

00:01:42.171 --> 00:01:43.004
(explosion)

00:01:43.004 --> 00:01:44.230
- Pretty much my whole life,

00:01:44.230 --> 00:01:46.494
my default setting has been half-ass.

00:01:46.494 --> 00:01:47.940
Woo hoo camp!

00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:50.690
Imagine as I literally beat you to death,

00:01:50.690 --> 00:01:53.120
that a giant hand has turned my dial

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:57.350
from half-ass to quadruple-ass.

00:01:57.350 --> 00:01:58.683
(screams)

00:01:58.683 --> 00:02:01.874
(machine gun firing)

00:02:01.874 --> 00:02:03.167
(gunshots)

00:02:03.167 --> 00:02:04.320
- Boo-ya kachow!

00:02:04.320 --> 00:02:07.130
I've been shot, stabbed,
set on fire, poisoned,

00:02:07.130 --> 00:02:10.120
shot, sexually assaulted,
partially chewed,

00:02:10.120 --> 00:02:12.310
shot, and declared legally dead,

00:02:12.310 --> 00:02:13.502
twice on the same day.

00:02:13.502 --> 00:02:15.170
- I think you might have a problem.

00:02:15.170 --> 00:02:16.783
- Yeah Lana, it's called cancer.

00:02:19.460 --> 00:02:20.520
- [Lana] Archer?
- Are you?

00:02:20.520 --> 00:02:22.153
- The man who cheated death?

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:26.475
I might be immortal.

00:02:26.475 --> 00:02:29.142
(group screams)

00:02:31.268 --> 00:02:34.698
- (laughing) This close.

00:02:34.698 --> 00:02:36.948
♪ Rebound ♪

00:02:41.071 --> 00:02:43.071
(sighs)

